- **Design**: Signal is the design language (R14EHYS, #298); Settings outlines and direct Signal selection (TV6RHDR, #291).
- **AI**: Claim standalone llama.cpp servers (Z629CEG, #292).
- **Platform**: NVIDIA/session handling across syncs (FWC4197, #290); VPN provider adapters groundwork (K4GXT0S, 3FYPM2Y, SGXK37F); theme and Sonar refinements; writer v2 adapter records (TVMBMGH); AgentEvents backlog to all holders (FMGA6ZW).
- **Tests & tooling**: Plugin id check skips comments (P758BCX); CI triage tool (`tools/ci/triage.py`); uninstall robustness improvements.

